<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Modern medicine with primitive measures, charge and throw a flask that flies through the air. When the flask lands, it creates a cloud of &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilence&lt;/font&gt; that slows down &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; inside of it by up to &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;30%&lt;/font&gt; and applies &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilence&lt;/font&gt;. This ability has a cooldown of 15 seconds.
Each &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; infected with &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilence&lt;/font&gt; gives the Cure a &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;5%&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Break&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Vault Speed boost&lt;/font&gt;.
&lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilence&lt;/font&gt; is automatically removed after &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;90 seconds&lt;/font&gt;.</string>
<string name="Name">move1</string>
