<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Gain access to your syringe, allowing you to inject downed &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; or corpses. Living &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; can only be injected once per chain stage. Before their first chain, injecting applies a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;4% Movement Speed slowdown&lt;/font&gt;. After one chain, injecting applies a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;6% Repair Speed slowdown&lt;/font&gt;. After two chains, injection transforms them into &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt;.

&lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt; moves at &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;9&lt;/font&gt; studs per second, increasing up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;15&lt;/font&gt; while chasing a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilent&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt;. They roam the map hunting &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt;, prioritizing the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; being chased by The Cure if they are within &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;100&lt;/font&gt; studs. Their attacks apply &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Pestilence&lt;/font&gt;, or deal damage if the target is already infected. &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt; can be killed by certain stuns, and their &lt;font color=&quot;#8E63D2&quot;&gt;auras&lt;/font&gt; are always &lt;font color=&quot;#8E63D2&quot;&gt;revealed&lt;/font&gt; to The Cure. There can only be up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt; instances of &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt;. &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; turned into &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt; can surpass this limit.

Corpses spawn around the map. Each time you chain a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt;, gain &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; charge to transform a corpse into an instance of &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2&lt;/font&gt;. The first chain grants &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; charge, and every charge after that requires &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; chains. The Cure also begins the round with up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;SCP-049-2s&lt;/font&gt; already spawned depending on the number of &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt;.</string>
<string name="Name">move2</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000009537</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.009980559349</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
