</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">When a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; frees another Survivor from a Chain or frees themselves, they gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;% &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;reduction to Healing Speed&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;60 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. The freed &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; suffers a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;15% Repair Speed penalty&lt;/font&gt; until they are healed.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Containment protocols are in place. If systems begin to fail… consider that part of the procedure.&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.744599938393</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
