<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.759999930859</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.270229250193</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">When a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; frees another Survivor from a Chain or frees themselves, they gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;% &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;reduction to Healing Speed&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;60 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. The freed &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; suffers a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;15% Repair Speed penalty&lt;/font&gt; until they are healed.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Containment protocols are in place. If systems begin to fail… consider that part of the procedure.&quot;</string>
<Color3 name="TextColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
