<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">When a Survivor sees your &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt;, you see theirs. Additionally, whenever you break a &lt;font color=&quot;#7FC8F8&quot;&gt;Pallet&lt;/font&gt; or gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;speed boost&lt;/font&gt;, your &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt; is revealed to the nearest Survivor for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;4 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. This perk has a cooldown of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;40&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt; seconds.
