<string name="Text">Your Heart Is Mine :</string>
<Color3 name="TextColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<bool name="TextScaled">true</bool>
<float name="TextSize">33.000000000000</float>
<float name="TextTransparency">0.059999998659</float>
<bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool>
<token name="TextXAlignment">0</token>
</Properties>
</Item>
<Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX74912">
<Properties>
<Vector2 name="AnchorPoint">
<X>0.500000000000</X>
<Y>0.500000000000</Y>
</Vector2>
<Color3 name="BackgroundColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<float name="BackgroundTransparency">1.000000000000</float>
<Color3 name="BorderColor3">
<R>0.000000000000</R>
<G>0.000000000000</G>
<B>0.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int>
<Font name="FontFace">
<Family><url>rbxassetid://12187377099</url></Family>
<Weight>400</Weight>
<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Cold iron for warm meat, wind up and cast a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;chain&lt;/font&gt; that can &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;latch&lt;/font&gt; on to &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; within &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt; studs. After being &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;latched&lt;/font&gt;, the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; is &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;Silenced&lt;/font&gt; and will be unable to get far from the killer. This chain wraps around the environment, has tension and takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; seconds for a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; to free themselves from.

After &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds and at a higher chain tension, you can recast the move to &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;interrupt any action&lt;/font&gt; and pull the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; towards you up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt; times, the third one &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stunning&lt;/font&gt; for longer and breaking the chain. If the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; was vaulting during a recast, they get &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stunned&lt;/font&gt; for longer. This ability has a &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;15&lt;/font&gt; second cooldown.</string>
<string name="Name">move1</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000009537</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.555395722389</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.939999997616</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.462490886450</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Cold iron for warm meat, wind up and cast a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;chain&lt;/font&gt; that can &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;latch&lt;/font&gt; on to &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; within &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt; studs. After being &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;latched&lt;/font&gt;, the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; is &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;Silenced&lt;/font&gt; and will be unable to get far from the killer. This chain wraps around the environment, has tension and takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; seconds for a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; to free themselves from.

After &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds and at a higher chain tension, you can recast the move to &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;interrupt any action&lt;/font&gt; and pull the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; towards you up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt; times, the third one &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stunning&lt;/font&gt; for longer and breaking the chain. If the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; was vaulting during a recast, they get &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stunned&lt;/font&gt; for longer. This ability has a &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;15&lt;/font&gt; second cooldown.</string>
<Color3 name="TextColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<bool name="TextScaled">true</bool>
<float name="TextSize">18.000000000000</float>
<float name="TextTransparency">0.059999998659</float>
<bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool>
<token name="TextXAlignment">0</token>
</Properties>
</Item>
<Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX74913">
<Properties>
<Vector2 name="AnchorPoint">
<X>0.500000000000</X>
<Y>0.500000000000</Y>
</Vector2>
<Color3 name="BackgroundColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<float name="BackgroundTransparency">1.000000000000</float>
<Color3 name="BorderColor3">
<R>0.000000000000</R>
<G>0.000000000000</G>
<B>0.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int>
<Font name="FontFace">
<Family><url>rbxassetid://12187377099</url></Family>
<Weight>400</Weight>
<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Iron teeth for running legs, set a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;steel trap&lt;/font&gt; on the ground in front of you. Setting a trap takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2.5&lt;/font&gt; seconds and it&apos;s armed the moment it touches the floor. The Butcher holds up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; traps, each one coming back after &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; traps can be set at once, setting another snaps the oldest one shut. &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; can disarm a set trap in &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds.

A &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; who steps in a trap is &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;injured&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stuck&lt;/font&gt; in place and &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;revealed&lt;/font&gt; to you. Struggling free takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt; seconds of special skill checks. Every great check takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; second off, and a missed check &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;cancels the attempt&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;reveals&lt;/font&gt; them again. A teammate can free them in &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; seconds.</string>
<string name="Name">move2</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000009537</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.078815460205</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.939999997616</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.415348351002</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Iron teeth for running legs, set a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;steel trap&lt;/font&gt; on the ground in front of you. Setting a trap takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2.5&lt;/font&gt; seconds and it&apos;s armed the moment it touches the floor. The Butcher holds up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; traps, each one coming back after &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Up to &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; traps can be set at once, setting another snaps the oldest one shut. &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; can disarm a set trap in &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds.

A &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; who steps in a trap is &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;injured&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;stuck&lt;/font&gt; in place and &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;revealed&lt;/font&gt; to you. Struggling free takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt; seconds of special skill checks. Every great check takes &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; second off, and a missed check &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;cancels the attempt&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;reveals&lt;/font&gt; them again. A teammate can free them in &lt;font color=&quot;#F5C542&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt; seconds.</string>
<Color3 name="TextColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
<bool name="TextScaled">true</bool>
