<Font name="FontFace">
<Family><url>rbxassetid://12187377099</url></Family>
<Weight>400</Weight>
<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Start the match with &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; token, to a max of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;. Every &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;55&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt; seconds, if an injured &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; exists, consume a token to see the furthest injured &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Gain tokens by damaging and chaining &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt;: one token per health state and one token per chain. Additionally, walking over a blood pool shows you the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; that left it for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; seconds.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;The smell of blood excites her as she closes in for the kill&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>2.611053228378</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.759999990463</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.364166051149</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Start the match with &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt; token, to a max of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;. Every &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;55&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt; seconds, if an injured &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; exists, consume a token to see the furthest injured &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Gain tokens by damaging and chaining &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt;: one token per health state and one token per chain. Additionally, walking over a blood pool shows you the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; that left it for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; seconds.
