<Font name="FontFace">
<Family><url>rbxassetid://12187377099</url></Family>
<Weight>400</Weight>
<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">When you are stunned by any means, stun the &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; responsible for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;11&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;22&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;33&lt;/font&gt;% of the duration, and apply &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;Silenced&lt;/font&gt; to every &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; within your intent radius for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Reveal affected survivors&apos; auras for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt; seconds.
While this perk is equipped, &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;Silenced&lt;/font&gt; pauses item recharge for the duration of the debuff.
This perk has a &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;30 second&lt;/font&gt; cooldown.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;She grew to enjoy the pain..&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.928235769272</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
