</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Damaging a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; slows all their actions (repairing, healing, vaulting, unchaining, opening gates and recovering) by &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10%&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;60&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;75&lt;/font&gt; seconds. The first time they complete a good skill check within this timeframe, a unique sound will happen and their aura will be revealed for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;6&lt;/font&gt; seconds.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Her smell lingers in the air&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
